      "text": "# Plan the expedition\n\nDrag the reminder card beside the relevant paragraph. These are native Canvas text cards.\n\n## Before departure\n\n- Meet [[People/Mira|Mira]] at [[Places/The old bridge|the old bridge]].\n- Check the map.\n\n| Item | Where |\n| --- | --- |\n| Silver compass | Mira |\n| Wildflower tea | The market |\n\nSearch for **Wildflower** to try an exact table hit."
